97
00:05:28,862 --> 00:05:32,944
A healthy wheel turns through a small number of trustworthy relationships,

98
00:05:32,944 --> 00:05:35,728
with real work supporting the next useful cycle.

99
00:05:37,379 --> 00:05:41,461
Recent production work gives the story something solid to stand on:

100
00:05:41,461 --> 00:05:45,368
review, correction, saving, and checking persisted results.

101
00:05:45,862 --> 00:05:49,556
Across language work, the important achievement is the chain of care

102
00:05:49,556 --> 00:05:51,878
