103
00:05:52,361 --> 00:05:56,580
You bring linguistic judgment. Tools help you navigate and work. Review

104
00:05:56,580 --> 00:05:59,164
catches details that the first pass may have missed.

105
00:05:59,647 --> 00:06:03,242
Then a fresh check helps establish that the intended changes remain

106
00:06:03,242 --> 00:06:05,876
