107
00:06:06,353 --> 00:06:10,073
This is where your years of learning start appearing inside repeatable

108
00:06:10,073 --> 00:06:13,743
behavior, rather than remaining only personal understanding.

109
00:06:14,219 --> 00:06:17,614
Did it preserve meaning? Did it protect the surrounding work? Can

110
00:06:17,614 --> 00:06:19,786
another reader verify what actually changed?

111
00:06:20,252 --> 00:06:24,234
These questions make production less theatrical and more dependable, which is

112
00:06:24,234 --> 00:06:26,281
