121
00:06:52,631 --> 00:06:56,201
Your recent translation notes include work that was saved and checked

122
00:06:56,201 --> 00:06:58,148
while remaining short of final submission.

123
00:06:58,631 --> 00:07:03,000
That is useful progress, and describing it accurately protects the judgment

124
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,873
